            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "Dungeon Marathon is a new style of game where you must run through Dungeons, no fighting allowed!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Warrior, Valkyrie, Wizard and Dwarf under the belief the dungeons are a gym, must run to survive the danger that lurks in the depths. Tricked by the old hag, will they sucumb to the many temptations or sprint to destiny...Only you will decide.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFrom Retro Army the creators and one-man team of 'Super trench attack', 'Verdict Guilty' and 'Death's Hangover' this is the latest in our budget range, and features our usual wacky humor and arcade style gameplay!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-&gt; 42 levels,<br />\r\n-&gt; Boss levels and scrolling level,<br />\r\n-&gt; 4 unique playable characters,<br />\r\n-&gt; Power-ups,<br />\r\n-&gt; Unique running gameplay,<br />\r\n-&gt; Collect apples to stay alive,<br />\r\n-&gt; Traditional Retro Army humor,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBe a part of the Mararthon!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPSD",
            "about_the_game": "Dungeon Marathon is a new style of game where you must run through Dungeons, no fighting allowed!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Warrior, Valkyrie, Wizard and Dwarf under the belief the dungeons are a gym, must run to survive the danger that lurks in the depths. Tricked by the old hag, will they sucumb to the many temptations or sprint to destiny...Only you will decide.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFrom Retro Army the creators and one-man team of 'Super trench attack', 'Verdict Guilty' and 'Death's Hangover' this is the latest in our budget range, and features our usual wacky humor and arcade style gameplay!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-&gt; 42 levels,<br />\r\n-&gt; Boss levels and scrolling level,<br />\r\n-&gt; 4 unique playable characters,<br />\r\n-&gt; Power-ups,<br />\r\n-&gt; Unique running gameplay,<br />\r\n-&gt; Collect apples to stay alive,<br />\r\n-&gt; Traditional Retro Army humor,<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBe a part of the Mararthon!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPSD",
